 result←object(State Point)arg;tunits;colors;points;pixels;t;scheme;props
 result←⍬
 ⍝ 'Point' r c [color]
 ⍝ 'Point' (n m ⍴ r c [color] ...) ...

 :If 1≥|≡arg ⋄ arg←,⊂arg ⋄ :EndIf
 '∆WI RANK ERROR: Point'##.Error∨/2<≢¨⍴¨arg
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Point'##.Error∨/~(⊢/¨⍴¨arg)∊¨⊂2 3
 arg←⊃⍪/3↑⍤1¨{(¯2↑1,⍴⍵)⍴⍵}¨arg,¨2⊃State._color_ ⍝ Default all colors and force into a single matrix
 'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error~##.IsNum arg[;1 2]
 'DOMAIN ERROR'##.Error~∧/##.IsInt¨colors←arg[;3]
 '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Point'##.Error~∧/(≢¨colors)∊¨⊂1 3
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Point'##.Error∨/(3=≢¨colors)∧∨/¨(colors<0)∨colors≥256
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Point'##.Error∨/(1=≢¨colors)∨∨/¨colors≥256*3
 '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Point'##.Error∨/(1=≢¨colors)∨∨/¨(colors<0)∧colors≥¯100
 :If ∨/t←1=≢¨colors
     scheme←##.GUIroot._color_scheme
     (t/colors)←(⊂⍬)##.Classes._supp.color2¨⊃¨t/colors ⍝ Convert scalars to Dyalog-form (errors if <¯120) ⍝? (De-duping might speed this up if needed)
     (t/colors)←scheme[1⌈scheme≢⍛⌊-t/colors] ⍝ Then convert Dyalog codes to RBG values
 :EndIf

 tunits←⊃##.Classes._supp.MyUnits State
 points←⌊0.5+tunits×⍤1⊢¯1↓⍤1⊢arg
 (colors points)←↓[1]colors{(⊃⍺) ⍵}⌸points ⍝ Group them by color
 props←StartObj 'Marker'
 props,←⊂'Style' 0 ⍝ Single pixels
 props,←('Points' points)('FCol' colors)
 State GUI props
